Release C SDK 0.4.0 with the 9P2000.L WM api

Import sophia-wm-files.md and sophia-output-files.md unmodified from
signed Sophia contract b0721d0de6a03cb44e57b0a923c6c385cf40b676. The
WM session now requires the exact api bytes naming output_transport=9p2000.L
and refuses the retired current_ipc value before negotiation.

Build and test guidance uses caller priority and the available CPUs.
